HOW IT'S MADE
---------------

- Install Go, or download and unarchive.

- To add modules:

    > go get github.com/dlclark/regexp2/v2@v2.2.2

    (Adjust the versions, or remove "@..." to get the latest versions)
    
- To build:

    > build.cmd

  (If required, set the path to 'go.exe', or set PATH variable and restart console)

- To test, for example:

    > test1.cmd

- Commit the changes (including the created "Regexp2Worker.exe").

- Build the main Visual Studio solution.
